sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Estimator as Estimator
    participant UI as Frontend SPA
    participant API as FastAPI Backend (main.py)
    participant Storage as File Storage (Local / Supabase)
    participant OCR as Local OCR / Parser
    participant LLM as External AI Gateway (AgentRouter)
    participant DB as Relational Database

    Estimator->>UI: Drags & drops RFQ document (PDF / Drawing / XLSX)
    UI->>API: POST /api/intake/file-extract (multipart/form-data, demo_only=bool)
    
    API->>Storage: persist_source() -> Writes raw binary payload
    Storage-->>API: file_id confirmed
    API->>DB: INSERT RFQSource (file_id, original_filename, size_bytes, media_type)
    
    API->>OCR: read_upload(filename, payload)
    alt Scanned PDF or Image Drawing
        OCR->>OCR: PyMuPDF pixmap rendering + pytesseract (Max 20 pages)
        OCR-->>API: Extracted raw text, method="pdf-ocr" / "image-ocr"
    else Excel Workbook (.xlsx)
        OCR->>OCR: openpyxl cell stream extraction
        OCR-->>API: Formatted rows, method="xlsx"
    else Vector PDF / Text
        OCR-->>API: Decoded text, method="pdf-text" / "text"
    end

    alt AI NDA Approved OR Demo Only Flag Set
        API->>LLM: POST gateway_chat(conservative extraction prompt)
        LLM-->>API: JSON {fields: [{name, value, source_excerpt, confidence}]}
        API->>API: Validate source_excerpt is exact substring of document text
        API->>API: Discard ungrounded or hallucinated fields
        API-->>UI: 200 OK (file_id, fields, method, ai_used=true)
    else NDA Not Approved / Customer Data Guard Active
        API->>API: rule_extract() -> Local regex patterns (Part, Material, Weight, Cycle, RFQ#)
        API-->>UI: 200 OK (file_id, fields, method, ai_used=false, note: "Local pattern suggestions only")
    end

    Estimator->>UI: Reviews suggestions, accepts/modifies, submits RFQ creation
    UI->>API: POST /api/rfqs {rfq_number, customer, due_date, parts, source_file_ids: [file_id]}
    API->>DB: Link RFQSource to created RFQ (rfq_sources.rfq_id)
    API->>DB: INSERT RFQ and Part records
    API-->>UI: 201 Created (RFQ register updated)
